  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<h3><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"Wares\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">承接契約。運送貨物。計算利潤。</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Wares</strong> 讓你能夠大量買賣物品。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>此模組主要為整合包設計。要建立配送契約，你需要編輯物品的 NBT 資料。<br>不過它也內建了一些內容：契約會在村莊倉庫中生成。</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c0XcCPI.png\" alt=\"說明\" width=\"1000\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PDiS0GR.png\" alt=\"表格\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">更多詳細資訊請參閱&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/mortuusars/Wares/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">評論由<strong>Mischief of Mice：</strong>提供</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8xb-xloKBqs?si=lTQ6E0n63tFxwNPT\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜歡這個模組嗎？&nbsp;你的支持將讓我能夠繼續開發本模組及其他模組！</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"108\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">看看我的其他模組：</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Exposure\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"Envelope\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PHaFgV2.png\" alt=\"Sooty Chimneys\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"Chalk\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"Monobank\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"Thief\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"Salt\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"Scholar\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"Horseman\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
